---

---

<footer class="site-foot">
  <div class="container site-foot__grid">
    <div class="site-foot__about">
      <p class="site-foot__brand">
        <span class="site-foot__en">BreakFree</span>
        <span class="site-foot__ar ar" lang="ar">تعافي</span>
      </p>
      <p class="site-foot__tag">
        <span class="t-en">
          An open-source recovery companion for Android, built from a hundred
          small honest choices.
        </span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">
          رفيق تعافٍ مفتوح المصدر على Android، مبنيّ من مئة اختيار صغير صادق.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="site-foot__nav mono" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Repository</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Issues</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">README</a>
    </nav>

    <p class="site-foot__note mono">
      <span class="t-en">No cookies. No analytics.<br />Nothing tracked — practice what we preach.</span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">لا كوكيز. لا تحليلات.<br />لا شيء يتتبّع — نطبّق ما نَعِدنا به.</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container site-foot__bottom mono">
    <span>© 2026 BreakFree contributors</span>
    <span>
      <span class="t-en">This site is static. It collects nothing.</span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">هذا الموقع ثابت. لا يجمع شيئًا.</span>
    </span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-foot {
    background: var(--night);
    color: var(--cream);
    transition:
      background-color 0.5s var(--ease-out),
      color 0.5s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .site-foot :focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--dawn-bright);
  }

  .site-foot__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr);
    gap: 2.5rem 4rem;
    padding-block: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
  }

  .site-foot__brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .site-foot__en {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 0, "WONK" 1;
    font-weight: 560;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .site-foot__ar {
    color: var(--dawn-bright);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .site-foot__tag {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: rgba(236, 228, 210, 0.65);
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  .site-foot__nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .site-foot__nav a,
  .site-foot__note {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .site-foot__nav a {
    color: rgba(236, 228, 210, 0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .site-foot__nav a:hover {
    color: var(--dawn-bright);
  }

  .site-foot__note {
    color: rgba(236, 228, 210, 0.55);
    line-height: 2;
    text-align: right;
    justify-self: end;
  }

  .site-foot__bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline-light);
    padding-block: 1.3rem 2rem;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(236, 228, 210, 0.45);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .site-foot__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.2rem;
    }

    .site-foot__note {
      text-align: left;
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
